        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            \( {@exp4@} =\) [[input:ans4]]
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                where \(a\) and \(b\) are constants.
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                wobei \(a\) und \(b\) Konstanten sind.
            </span>
            <br/>
